<title>USA: GelTex Pharms names Paul Mellett CFO.</title>
<headline>GelTex Pharms names Paul Mellett CFO.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>GelTex Pharmaceuticals Inc on Thursday said Paul Mellett has been appointment vice president of administration and finance and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Mellett joins GelTex from Marshall Contractors Inc, where he most recently served as chief financial officer.  </p>
<p>The company said the CFO postion was newly-created for Mellett.  Accounting and financial matters were previously handled by other members of the firm.</p>
